# Mouse without Borders Setup & Troubleshooting

- [x] Install PowerToys on all 3 computers
- [x] Configure Security Key & Computer Name on all computers
- [x] specific firewall rules ("Allow app through firewall") on all computers
- [ ] **Check Network Interface Selection** (Current Step)
- [ ] Check Connection Status (Connected/Linked?)
- [ ] Enable "Use Service" mode
- [ ] Restart PowerToys/Computers
